    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. We're also seeing some pattern anomalies in the frequency of outgoing packets from the Chancellor's private office. It's almost as if someone is trying to timestamp the bursts to map out the decision-making cycle. How should I go about formatting the \"administrative\" payloads so the traffic looks completely organic and non-rhythmic, even during high-stakes periods?",
