      "content": "That's helpful. One more thing—I'm concerned that if we use standard steganography, a sophisticated actor in the oversight committee might notice the sudden uptick in high-entropy files. Given the level of access they have to the hardware, should we prioritize methods that involve hiding data within the timing of the signals themselves, or is that too risky for something this sensitive?",
